{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314","id":6025106171,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_S-w","number":314,"title":"[消息队列 MQ06] 消息保序：订单已退款，为什么又变回已支付？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:08:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq06 -->\n\n**核心顺序6/9；MQ06仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n本系列统一Kafka。本片沿分区日志追踪业务执行顺序；MQ05的重复效果与MQ15的副本确认分别由独立选题处理。\n\n不同订单可以并行处理，同一订单的支付与退款怎样按业务顺序完成？\n\n1. 本片自行建立订单ID、不同业务事件和Kafka分区日志；先展示两个不同事件倒序完成，使订单从已退款错误变成已支付，明确这不是重复消息问题。\n2. 固定分区数与已确定的生产顺序，将同一订单Key路由到同一分区，由传统消费组实例按该顺序串行处理；不同订单仍可分布到其他分区并行。\n3. 保持同一日志顺序，只改消费者内部为异步并发，让支付完成晚于退款；用反例说明有序到达不自动带来业务有序完成。\n\n观众应能指出保序需要沿生产、路由、消费执行共同成立的条件。本片聚焦一条订单链，不同时讲分区扩容迁移或所有产品的保序参数。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n使用相同订单与事件序列，对照“同Key同分区＋串行处理”和“同一日志＋应用内部乱序完成”。同时展示日志位置与业务完成顺序，核对问题来自哪一步；切换分支先重置订单状态，不能靠隐藏执行时长制造结论。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n固定Kafka传统consumer group、分区数、生产配置与消费处理方式。同Key只约束路由，不自动定义多个生产者之间的业务先后；重试与生产幂等配置也会影响顺序。增加分区可能改变Key映射，旧数据不会自动移入新分区；这些条件放图文说明，不伪装成全局有序。幂等不能替代保序，迟到的有效增量也不能一律丢弃。\n\n- [Kafka 4.4 Producer Configs](https://kafka.apache.org/44/configuration/producer-configs/)：重试、幂等与生产顺序条件。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Design](https://kafka.apache.org/44/design/design/)：分区顺序与消费组模型。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Basic Operations](https://kafka.apache.org/44/operations/basic-kafka-operations/)：扩分区的Key映射边界。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；本片自带必要前提，不以其他章节为观看条件。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c